1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,670
Markets move in seconds.

2
00:00:01,670 --> 00:00:02,974
Hype moves faster.

3
00:00:02,974 --> 00:00:10,172
In 2020, the SEC suspended ZOOM after raising concerns that investors were confusing it with a similarly named company.

4
00:00:10,172 --> 00:00:15,549
Today, real-world assets are moving onchain, and a familiar name can hide a bigger difference.

5
00:00:15,549 --> 00:00:20,247
A product can track a price without giving you company ownership, voting rights, or redemption.

6
00:00:20,247 --> 00:00:24,590
TrueGuard checks the real asset, the token rights, and what the user actually wants.

7
00:00:24,590 --> 00:00:27,219
Then it links every important answer to proof.

8
00:00:27,219 --> 00:00:36,034
And when small holders of the same token want to sell, ExitTogether combines compatible orders to seek one large-order quote, while each holder keeps a minimum.

9
00:00:36,034 --> 00:00:36,928
Know what you own.

10
00:00:36,928 --> 00:00:38,157
Protect how you exit.

11
00:00:38,157 --> 00:00:38,965
TrueGuard.

